Package: moewbgt
Title: Access Heat Index (WBGT) and Heat Stroke Alert Data from the Japanese
    Ministry of the Environment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shinya", "Uryu", email = "uryu.shinya@tokushima-u.ac.jp",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieve and parse heat index (WBGT) forecast and observed values,
    and heat stroke alert announcements, published by the Heat Illness
    Prevention Information site of the Japanese Ministry of the Environment
    (<https://www.wbgt.env.go.jp/>). The site serves seasonal CSV downloads and,
    since fiscal 2026, a WebAPI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
